<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-270] Scaladoc has link on a non-existing page at docs.scala-lang.org </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-270</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. Open Ignite Scaladoc&lt;br/&gt;
2. Click on ScalarAbsClosure&lt;br/&gt;
3. On right frame in &quot;Inherited&quot; area click on &quot;Learn more about member selection&quot;. It opens new window with link &lt;a href=&quot;http://docs.scala-lang.org/overviews/scaladoc/usage.html#members&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://docs.scala-lang.org/overviews/scaladoc/usage.html#members&lt;/a&gt; but this URL doesn&apos;t exist on scala-org site any more.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additional information as here:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-6131&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-6131&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/scala/scala.github.com/blob/master/overviews/scaladoc/usage.md&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/scala/scala.github.com/blob/master/overviews/scaladoc/usage.md&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
